cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use vakint, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI for the version you
  used.
title: vakint
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hirschi
    given-names: Valentin
    affiliation: University of Bern
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8908-6300"
abstract: >-
  Vakint computes single-scale vacuum integrals in high-energy physics through
  topology matching, tensor reduction, analytical methods, and numerical sector
  decomposition.
keywords:
  - vacuum integrals
  - Feynman integrals
  - quantum field theory
  - high-energy physics
  - Rust
license: MIT
